# The database the test suite uses. Never your real one.
#
# Tests create and delete workspaces, users and agents. On 2026-11-10 a
# test clean-up bug ran against the dev database and deleted every
# workspace in it. Since then, tests only run against a database whose
# name ends in "_test" (enforced in tests/guard.ts).
#
# This is a local, throwaway database with a test-only password, so it's
# safe to commit. One-time setup (asks for your postgres password):
#   psql -U postgres -h localhost -c "CREATE ROLE kolumna_test LOGIN PASSWORD 'kolumna_test' CREATEDB;" -c "CREATE DATABASE kolumna_test OWNER kolumna_test;"
# The schema is applied automatically before each run (tests/global-setup.ts).
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://kolumna_test:kolumna_test@localhost:5432/kolumna_test"
